<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the French</p>
<p>first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>3 - Anto Drobnjak (Bastia), Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille).</p>
<p>2 -  Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Enzo Scifo (Monaco),</p>
<p>Vladimir Smicer (Lens), Christopher Wreh (Guingamp).</p>
</text>
